av74_kara.dialogstring_06D2FF! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](That smile[AD] Kara is[N]always prettiest when[N]she smiles.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_ishtar'
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06CEF2! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Ishtar: You came for the[N]girl, didn't you? Kara,[N]was it?[WAI][N]Then pass through the[N]rooms ahead.[WAI][N]Solve each mystery, and I[N]will show you how to[N]restore her.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_apprentice'
av75_apprentice.dialogstring_06DC97! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Ishtar's apprentice: You[N]may pass once you solve[N]the puzzle in the room[N]before you.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_doors'
av75_voice_doors.dialogstring_06D83E! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Patience. Open the doors[N]in order, beginning with[N]the one on the left.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_rooms'
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DA14! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Study this room carefully.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]When you believe you have[N]memorized every detail,[N]leave it behind.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DA6B! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Find what differs from the[N]room you saw before.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DAF0! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Correct![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]You noticed the jar was a[N]different color.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Very good. Continue to the[N]next room.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_doors'
av75_voice_doors.dialogstring_06D87B! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]That door has already been[N]opened. There's no need to[N]open it again.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_rooms'
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB2C! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Correct. Continue to the[N]next room.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB4F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Correct. The contents of[N]the chest changed.[N]Continue to the next room.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB9F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Correct. The draft made[N]your hair move.[FIN]You've passed my tests.[N]You may return.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_ishtar'
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06CF5E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Ishtar: I have been[N]waiting for you.[FIN]Sprinkle this Magic[N]Powder over the girl's[N]portrait, then give her[N]a heartfelt kiss.[FIN]If your feelings are true,[N]something should happen.[WAI][N]As for me, my work is[N]finished.[FIN]I painted my own portrait.[WAI][N]Look at it. It will never[N]grow old. It will never[N]become sick.[FIN]It will never lose its[N]beauty to time.[WAI][N]A portrait never changes.[N]That is its perfection.[FIN]Soon I will become part[N]of mine as well.[WAI][N]That girl[AD] take care of[N]her.[END]`
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06D039! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_kara'
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D278! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](First I need to use the[N]Magic Powder[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393C5! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Tried using the magic[N]powder.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393EA! `But nothing happens![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393FA! `Sprinkled the magic powder[N]on the picture of Kara![END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_kara'
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D2A4! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Please, Kara.[N]Come back to us…[FIN][CLD][DEF][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Will gently kisses[N]Kara's portrait.[END]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D339! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Will… I'm sorry for[N]being selfish…[FIN]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D364! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: You scared all of[N]us half to death![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Will]You can't keep running off[N]without thinking about the[N]people who care about you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: …[END]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D3CC! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Waaaaaaaaaaah![N]*Sob*… *Sniff*…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Why do I keep doing things[N]like this…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]The castle always felt[N]safe. There were walls and[N]guards,[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]and if everything became[N]too much…[N]I could always hide in[N]my room.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Things are different out[N]here. I need to be[N]stronger.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]If only so you don't have[N]to worry about me so much.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]I left because I wanted[N]to see the world with my[N]own eyes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Inside that painting, I[N]could see everything…[N]but couldn't do anything.[N]But you came for me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Of course I did.[N]I was worried.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That's not what I[N]meant…![N]Sometimes you feel close,[N]even when you're far away.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]And sometimes far away,[N]even when you're[N]right beside me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]You probably don't[N]understand.[N]That's fine. I won't[N]forget today.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_erik'
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C568! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Kara![N]We were worried sick![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Why do you always[N]run off alone?![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Don't you think about how[N]the rest of us feel?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Will already[N]gave me quite a lecture.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]So… I'm sorry, everyone.[FIN][CLD][DEF][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1]Kara bows her head.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: She understands.[N]Let's leave it there.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Watermia is about three[N]days south of here.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]We'll leave when everyone[N]is ready. Come tell me[N]when you want to go.[END]`
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C6A0! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Oh! That reminds me![FIN]Back in Fallen Wing[N]Village, I think I saw a[N]shiny Red Jewel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lily'
av6A_lily.dialogstring_06C2F8! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Kara is acting[N]strange, isn't she?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]I have a sense for these[N]things. Did something[N]happen between you two?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lance'
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BFBE! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Looks like Lilly's[N]birthday will come while[N]we're in the Floatin'[N]City[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_kara'
av6A_kara.dialogstring_06C417! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They say Watermia[N]is built from houses[N]floating on rafts.[WAI][N]Doesn't that sound[N]romantic? I think it'll[N]be fun.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_neil'
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C10D! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Ready to go?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] Wait a bit[PAL:4]`
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C136! `[CLR]Neil: Don't rush things.[N]Take your time finishing[N]your business.[END]`
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C15C! `[CLR]Neil: Watermia is supposed[N]to be very hot.[FIN]Drink plenty of water and[N]don't overdo it.[END]`
